Description: Barq Downloader: fast downloads for HunarOS
 Barq (Urdu: lightning) downloads files over several connections at once with
 aria2, pauses and resumes (also after a restart), keeps a queue sorted into
 categories (video, music, documents, programs, archives), limits the speed,
 and has a scheduler (e.g. at night, then sleep or shut down). Videos and music
 from YouTube and many other sites are downloaded with yt-dlp in the quality
 you choose.
